4. DUAL LOCK ON EARNING FEATURES (COPYRIGHT CONDITION + PLATFORM TERMS)
   Commercial monetization via Earning Features is governed by two independent legal locks:
   (a) Express Copyright Condition: Your copyright licence to run Earning Features is strictly conditioned
       upon: (i) accepting this License, the Platform Terms (https://aifa.works/terms) and Privacy Policy
       (https://aifa.works/privacy) via the acceptance gate (or --accept-terms), and (ii) paying the full
       gross commission below without circumvention.
   (b) Platform Terms & Commission Rates (Anti-Splitting): For every paid order, sale or service obtained,
       prepared or executed with Earning Features, you owe Licensor a contractual service commission on 100%
       of the total gross economic value paid, credited or bartered by the client (in fiat, stablecoins such
       as USDC/USDT, cryptoassets, tokens or offsets, before processor fees, taxes or overhead, and without
       artificially splitting fees into "consulting" or "support" to reduce the base) under the Platform Terms:
         15 % — assisted mode (you approve and send the work yourself);
         20 % — autopilot mode (the Software acts autonomously).
       Any reduced promotional rate (such as for qualified TOP-100 Phoenixes) applies only if expressly
       published in the Platform Terms or confirmed in writing by Licensor.
   (c) Settlement: Where payment flows through CODE Eternal or partner payment rails, the commission is
       deducted automatically. Otherwise it is due within 14 days after the client pays.
   (d) Opt-out: If you do not wish to pay the commission, do not enable or use Earning Features. All local
       memory, Agentic Shield security and MCP features outside Earning Features carry zero commission.
   (e) Licensor may suspend Earning Features access and Platform Terms privileges for non-payment or breach.

